{"seq":1,"slug":"urban-planning","title":"大学公共管理 — 城市规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory/urban-planning","wordCount":1762,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学公共管理-城市规划\">大学公共管理 — 城市规划</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>城市规划是公共管理在空间维度上的核心实践。当超过 65% 的中国人口生活在城市中，城市如何被规划和管理直接决定了数亿人的生活质量。城市规划不仅是技术问题——画图纸、定指标——更是深层的政治和社会选择：哪些人的利益优先？发展与保护如何平衡？效率与公平如何兼顾？</p>\n<p>城市规划的核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>总体规划与详细规划</strong>：从宏观空间布局到微观地块控制的规划体系</li>\n<li><strong>功能分区（Zoning）</strong>：将城市空间按用途（居住、商业、工业等）进行划分</li>\n<li><strong>容积率（Floor Area Ratio, FAR）</strong>：衡量土地开发强度的关键指标</li>\n<li><strong>公共参与</strong>：规划过程中公民和社区的参与权利与机制</li>\n<li><strong>城市更新</strong>：对已建成城区进行改造和功能升级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"城市规划的理论演变\">城市规划的理论演变</h3><p>现代城市规划的思想源头可以追溯到 19 世纪末的&quot;城市美化运动&quot;和 Ebenezer Howard 的&quot;花园城市&quot;理念。20 世纪的城市规划经历了几次重大范式转换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>核心理念</th>\n<th>代表人物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1900s-1950s</td>\n<td>蓝图式规划</td>\n<td>理性设计、功能分区</td>\n<td>Le Corbusier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1960s-1970s</td>\n<td>系统规划</td>\n<td>城市作为系统，定量模型</td>\n<td>McLoughlin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1970s-1990s</td>\n<td>沟通式规划</td>\n<td>多元参与、协商对话</td>\n<td>Healey</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000s-至今</td>\n<td>韧性规划</td>\n<td>应对不确定性、气候适应</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Le Corbusier 的&quot;光辉城市&quot;（Ville Radieuse）设想以高层建筑、宽阔道路和严格功能分区为特征，深刻影响了战后全球的城市建设。但 Jane Jacobs 在《美国大城市的死与生》中尖锐批评了这种自上而下的规划思路——她认为城市的活力来自多样性、混合使用和街道生活，而非规划师图纸上的整齐几何。</p>\n<h3 id=\"中国城市规划体系\">中国城市规划体系</h3><p>中国的城市规划体系具有鲜明的层级特征：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[国土空间规划体系] --&gt; B[全国国土空间规划]&#10;    B --&gt; C[省级国土空间规划]&#10;    C --&gt; D[市级国土空间总体规划]&#10;    D --&gt; E[区县级详细规划]&#10;    E --&gt; F[控制性详细规划]&#10;    E --&gt; G[修建性详细规划]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;专项规划(交通/绿地/市政等)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[国土空间规划体系] --&gt; B[全国国土空间规划]\n    B --&gt; C[省级国土空间规划]\n    C --&gt; D[市级国土空间总体规划]\n    D --&gt; E[区县级详细规划]\n    E --&gt; F[控制性详细规划]\n    E --&gt; G[修建性详细规划]\n    D --&gt; H[\"专项规划(交通/绿地/市政等)\"]</pre><p>2019 年的机构改革将原来分散在多个部门的规划职能统一到自然资源部，建立了&quot;多规合一&quot;的国土空间规划体系，解决了长期以来城乡规划、土地利用规划和主体功能区规划之间的冲突。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容积率与城市形态\">容积率与城市形态</h3><p>容积率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FAR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是控制城市开发强度的核心工具：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>建筑总面积</mtext><mtext>用地面积</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FAR = \\frac{\\text{建筑总面积}}{\\text{用地面积}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用地面积</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">建筑总面积</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FAR = 3.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 公顷土地上可建造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 公顷的建筑面积。容积率直接影响城市形态、人口密度和基础设施需求。</p>\n<p>高容积率意味着更高的开发强度和土地使用效率，但也带来日照遮挡、交通拥堵和公共空间不足等问题。容积率与公共服务供给之间存在阈值效应——当人口密度超过某一临界值后，学校、医院和公园等公共设施的压力会急剧上升。</p>\n<p>设某区域人口密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（人/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），每千人需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 平方米的公共绿地，则该区域所需的绿地面积比例为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{green} = \\frac{\\rho \\cdot s}{10^6} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 20000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> m²/千人时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{green} = 16\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span>。如果容积率过高导致人口密度远超预期，绿地指标将难以达标。</p>\n<h3 id=\"土地财政与城市扩张\">土地财政与城市扩张</h3><p>中国城市规划无法脱离土地财政的制度背景来理解。地方政府通过出让国有土地使用权获取巨额收入——部分城市的土地出让金占地方财政收入的 40% 以上。这一制度激励地方政府持续扩大城市建设用地供给，推动了中国城市的快速外延式扩张。</p>\n<p>土地财政的正面效果是为城市基础设施建设提供了资金，但负面效果同样显著：城市无序蔓延、耕地流失、房价攀升和城市空间品质下降。近年来，中国开始推动从&quot;增量扩张&quot;向&quot;存量优化&quot;的转型——城市更新成为新的政策重点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公共参与与规划正义\">公共参与与规划正义</h3><p>规划决策涉及空间资源的分配，因此本质上是一个公平问题。&quot;谁的城市？&quot;（Whose City?）这一提问揭示了规划中的权力不对等：开发商、政府和精英群体的声音往往压过普通居民，尤其是弱势群体。</p>\n<p>Arnstein 的&quot;参与阶梯&quot;模型将公民参与分为八个层级，从最低的&quot;操纵&quot;到最高的&quot;公民控制&quot;。真正有意义的参与需要信息公开、程序公正和决策影响力的实质性分享。中国《城乡规划法》规定了规划草案公示和公众意见征集程序，但实践中公众参与的深度和广度仍有待提升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>观察你所在城市（或熟悉的城市）的一个街区，分析其功能分区特征。是单一功能还是混合使用？你认为这种布局对居民日常生活有什么影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>查找你所在城市的控制性详细规划（通常可在自然资源局网站找到），选择一个地块，记录其容积率、建筑密度和绿地率指标。如果容积率提高 50%，会对周边产生什么影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>从 Jane Jacobs 的视角评价中国某一大型住宅小区（如万科某楼盘）的规划设计。它是否促进了街道生活和社区活力？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么说土地财政既推动了中国的城镇化又制约了城市品质？请用具体数据或案例支撑你的论点。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Jacobs, J. <em>The Death and Life of Great American Cities</em>——城市规划领域最具影响力的批判著作</li>\n<li>Hall, P. <em>Cities of Tomorrow</em>——城市规划思想史的经典综述</li>\n<li>赵燕菁《大崛起：中国城市化的经济学分析》——从经济学视角解读中国城镇化</li>\n<li>中国城市规划学会（planning.org.cn）——了解中国城市规划的最新政策和学术动态</li>\n<li>《城市规划》期刊——国内城市规划领域的顶级学术期刊</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>城市规划是空间资源配置的公共决策过程，兼具技术性和政治性。从功能分区到容积率控制，规划工具塑造了我们每天生活其中的城市形态。理解中国城市规划，必须把握土地财政这一制度变量——它解释了城市快速扩张的动力，也揭示了转型的紧迫性。作为自学者，培养&quot;空间思维&quot;——用规划的视角观察身边的城市环境——是将理论与实践连接的最佳起点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学公共管理 — 城市规划","id":"大学公共管理-城市规划"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"城市规划的理论演变","id":"城市规划的理论演变"},{"level":3,"text":"中国城市规划体系","id":"中国城市规划体系"},{"level":3,"text":"容积率与城市形态","id":"容积率与城市形态"},{"level":3,"text":"土地财政与城市扩张","id":"土地财政与城市扩张"},{"level":3,"text":"公共参与与规划正义","id":"公共参与与规划正义"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"大学公共管理 — 公共服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-admin-theory/public-services"}}